# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# 2026-07-31 — the engraved sign, the hand-carved cardinal and the picture
# frame came off the shelf and became quoted custom work (Jeff's call: they
# need too much per-piece adjustment to carry a fixed price). Their product
# pages are retired.
#
# These send anyone holding an old link to the custom-work page, which is
# where all ten of their photographs now live, instead of a 404. 301 because
# the move is permanent. Both the clean and .html forms, because the site
# serves extensionless URLs and 308s the .html form — without the second line
# an old .html link would redirect to a page that no longer exists.
/p-sign          /custom  301
/p-sign.html     /custom  301
/p-cardinal      /custom  301
/p-cardinal.html /custom  301
/p-frame         /custom  301
/p-frame.html    /custom  301
